title: The Storming of Vorwärts
subtitle: 11 January. The Potsdam regiment brings up field guns.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: crisis_january = 1 and crisis_time = 2
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.e19_noske += 3;
var lost = Math.round(Q.e19_noske / 2) - Q.e19_arms;
lost = Math.min(Q.e19_buildings, Math.max(1, lost));
Q.e19_buildings -= lost;
Q.e19_left = Q.e19_buildings;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Buildings held: ' + Q.e19_buildings + ' of 6';
Q.crisis_line_2 = 'Noske\'s volunteers: ' + Q.e19_noske + ',000, in the city';
RG.news('Government troops storm the Vorwärts building', 3);
!}

= The Storming of Vorwärts

At dawn Major von Stephani's regiment shelled the *Vorwärts* building with field guns and mortars. The defenders sent out seven men under a white flag. The soldiers beat them and shot them in the yard of the Dragoon barracks. That afternoon Noske marched into Berlin at the head of his volunteers.

[? if e19_left >= 2 : Some of the other buildings still hold, and their defenders have seen what happens to men who surrender. ?][? if e19_left = 1 : One building still holds. ?][? if e19_left = 0 : By evening every building has fallen. What is left is a few hundred armed men in the courtyards and stairwells of the district. ?]

- @hold: Fight it out where they stand.
- @retreat: Get the fighters out through the courtyards.
- @terms: Surrender through the Independents.

@hold
subtitle: A legend for the Berlin factories, and a massacre.
on-arrival: {!
Q.january_outcome = 1;
Q.militancy += 8;
Q.district_berlin_members -= 0.6;
Q.lean_ultraleft += 2;
Q.e19_buildings = 0;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Buildings held: none';
!}

The last buildings fall under artillery fire. Prisoners are shot in the yards.

@retreat
subtitle: [? if e19_arms = 0 : Pieck gives it no better than even odds. ?][? if e19_arms >= 1 : With rifles to cover the yards, Pieck thinks most of them can get out. ?]
on-arrival: {!
var chance = Math.min(0.85, 0.45 + 0.2 * Q.e19_arms);
Q.january_outcome = Math.random() < chance ? 2 : 1;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 2;
Q.e19_buildings = 0;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Buildings held: none';
if (Q.january_outcome == 1) { Q.district_berlin_members -= 0.4; }
!}

[? if january_outcome = 2 : Most of the fighters slip away through the back courts of the Lindenstrasse with their rifles under their coats. The soldiers storm empty rooms. ?][? if january_outcome = 1 : The soldiers have closed the courts behind the buildings. Few get out. ?]

@terms
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The fighters go home and the leaders face the courts. The Left will not forgive it.
choose-if: e19_talks = 1 and lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: Nobody is talking to the government on our behalf.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
Q.january_outcome = 2;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
Q.offensive_satisfaction -= 6;
Q.district_berlin_loyalty -= 8;
Q.e19_buildings = 0;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 'Buildings held: none';
!}

Oskar Cohn of the Independents gets a promise: no shootings. It is mostly kept.
